      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2125062053358374957",
      "text": "#Isles have just one shot in this third period.",
      "url": "https://x.com/stefen_rosner/status/2125062053358374957",
      "published": "2026-11-24T03:00:49+00:00",
      "likes": 17,
      "author": "Stefen Rosner",
      "handle": "stefen_rosner",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2107797565768876032/Mb8HQ_H3_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2125059605432848430",
      "text": "Raddysh, who took the point shot, was the player who injured Barzal a few years ago. Not saying that's why he jumped out of the way...but it just so happened to be same guy. #Isles",
      "url": "https://x.com/stefen_rosner/status/2125059605432848430",
      "published": "2026-11-24T02:51:06+00:00",
      "likes": 19,
      "author": "Stefen Rosner",
      "handle": "stefen_rosner",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2107797565768876032/Mb8HQ_H3_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "On the delayed penalty, McKenna scores with 11:05 to go in the third period to give #TOR a 3-2 lead. Barzal jumped out of the way of a blast and while Sorokin made the save, McKenna was there. #Isles",
      "quoted_author": "Stefen Rosner",
      "quoted_handle": "stefen_rosner"
    },
    {
      "id": "2125059419130187800",
      "text": "The Leafs have taken over this game since the start of the second period and they now lead 3-2, looking to end their nine-game winless streak.",
      "url": "https://x.com/drosennhl/status/2125059419130187800",
      "published": "2026-11-24T02:50:21+00:00",
      "likes": 3,
      "author": "Dan Rosen",
      "handle": "drosennhl",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2089371725200801792/XL1SL09C_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "Mathew Barzal with a beauty for his first goal of the season. Protected the puck from William Nylander, cut inside Aatu Raty and ripped a wrister glove side. The Islanders are simply a faster and more dynamic team with him on the ice, and making plays like that one.",
      "quoted_author": "Dan Rosen",
      "quoted_handle": "drosennhl"
    },
    {
      "id": "2125059196647321673",
      "text": "On the delayed penalty, McKenna scores with 11:05 to go in the third period to give #TOR a 3-2 lead. Barzal jumped out of the way of a blast and while Sorokin made the save, McKenna was there. #Isles",
      "url": "https://x.com/stefen_rosner/status/2125059196647321673",
      "published": "2026-11-24T02:49:28+00:00",
      "likes": 6,
      "author": "Stefen Rosner",
      "handle": "stefen_rosner",
