      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2125059148572442668",
      "text": "Long delayed penalty against #Isles, who can't touch puck, and #Leafs go up 302 at 8:55 of the third. McKenna at the left post.",
      "url": "https://x.com/AGrossNewsday/status/2125059148572442668",
      "published": "2026-11-24T02:49:17+00:00",
      "likes": 2,
      "author": "Andrew Gross",
      "handle": "AGrossNewsday",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/364012061/n1042077731_9886_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2125059087369118120",
      "text": "Gavin McKenna on a delayed penalty puts home a rebound. It's 3-2 Leafs, and the #Isles are 11:05 away from a really bad loss.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JoePantorno/status/2125059087369118120",
